

📘 SSC CGL Maths Syllabus

✅ 1. Number System (संख्या पद्धति)

Whole numbers

Integers

Fractions

LCM & HCF

Divisibility rules

Simplification

Surds & Indices


✅ 2. Algebra (बीजगणित)

Basic algebraic identities

Linear equations

Quadratic equations

Polynomials

Factorization

Algebraic expressions


✅ 3. Percentage (प्रतिशत)

Conversion to fractions

Percentage increase/decrease

Successive percentage


✅ 4. Profit and Loss (लाभ और हानि)

Cost price, selling price

Discount

Marked price

Successive profit/loss


✅ 5. Simple Interest and Compound Interest (साधारण ब्याज और चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज)

Principal, rate, and time-based questions

Difference between CI and SI


✅ 6. Ratio and Proportion (अनुपात और समानुपात)

Simplification of ratios

Proportionality

Compound ratio


✅ 7. Partnership (साझेदारी)

Division of profit

Working and sleeping partners


✅ 8. Mixture and Alligation (मिश्रण और मणिकर्ण)

Milk-water mixtures

Replacement problems


✅ 9. Time and Work (समय और कार्य)

Work efficiency

Wages

Pipes and cisterns


✅ 10. Time, Speed and Distance (समय, गति और दूरी)

Average speed

Relative speed

Trains

Boats and streams


✅ 11. Mensuration (क्षेत्रमिति)

2D: Square, Rectangle, Triangle, Circle, etc.

3D: Cube, Cuboid, Cylinder, Cone, Sphere, Hemisphere


✅ 12. Geometry (ज्यामिति)

Lines, angles

Triangles and their properties

Congruence and similarity

Circles (chords, tangents, angles)

Quadrilaterals and polygons

Coordinate geometry (basics)


✅ 13. Trigonometry (त्रिकोणमिति)

Trigonometric ratios and identities

Heights and distances

Complementary angles


✅ 14. Data Interpretation (सांख्यिकी व्याख्या)

Bar graphs

Pie charts

Line graphs

Tables


✅ 15. Average (औसत)

Simple average

Weighted average


✅ 16. Age Problems (आयु से संबंधित प्रश्न)




